[{"client_msg_id":"efab22ce-f157-4249-899d-a79be7545769","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"へー","ts":"1626791936.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJPAi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74309585-9ca1-4bfc-86eb-2ce91b6b9d68","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"switch の抜けがあるからそのまま使わない方がいいかも。","ts":"1626790328.158800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/V5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff9b0e28-53c1-4aca-8c76-aa45e922ab16","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"他の型サポートしてないけど。","ts":"1626789691.157800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hLKBt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0514cf33-a07f-48c7-89c8-e430a20bc720","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```func wrap(f interface{}) func(js.Value, []js.Value) interface{} {\n\treturn func(this js.Value, args []js.Value) interface{} {\n\t\trf := reflect.ValueOf(f)\n\t\trt := rf.Type()\n\t\trargs := []reflect.Value{}\n\t\tfor i := 0; i \u0026lt; rt.NumIn(); i++ {\n\t\t\tvar arg reflect.Value\n\t\t\tswitch args[i].Type() {\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeUndefined:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.Zero(reflect.TypeOf(nil)).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeNull:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.Zero(reflect.TypeOf(nil)).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeBoolean:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].Bool()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeNumber:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].Float()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeString:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].String()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeSymbol:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].String()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeObject:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].JSValue()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\tcase js.TypeFunction:\n\t\t\t\targ = reflect.ValueOf(args[i].JSValue()).Convert(rt.In(i))\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\trargs = append(rargs, arg)\n\t\t}\n\t\tret := rf.Call(rargs)\n\t\tif len(ret) \u0026gt; 0 {\n\t\t\treturn ret[0].Interface()\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n}```","ts":"1626789661.157500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"god","count":4,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aWE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e1a5afe-4371-4c94-8198-bc0e363d7a3a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"raa さんのやつ\n```func add(this js.Value, args []js.Value) interface{} {\n\treturn js.ValueOf(args[0].Int() + args[1].Int())\n}```\nこれを\n```func add(lhs, rhs int) int {\n    return lhs + rhs\n}```\n```js.Global().Set(\"GoAdd\", js.FuncOf(wrap(add)))```\nって書ける方法あります。","ts":"1626789636.157300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pa="}]},{"client_msg_id":"24370237-ee5a-4f14-9352-bf86e8c3159b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"raa さんの denops-go-example を試すなどした。結構綺麗に動くもんなんですね。","ts":"1626789407.156300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"god","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d5PV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be52755e-2a85-4d29-8db7-77d0d31878f8","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"昨日denopsでGoを動かすテストをしていた時の作業跡がそのまま起動したのを見てやっぱ遅延ロード必要だなーなどと思っていた(メモリのため)","ts":"1626780793.154200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/8/F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb6235dd-a08f-49a9-bf98-07ed8eb56c86","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"考慮漏れっぽそうなのでPR出してみるとよさそうな気がします","ts":"1626780473.153300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"muscle","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id